#: ../Pinta.Tools/Tools/ShapeTool.cs:59
#, fuzzy, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Left click to draw a shape with the primary color.\n"
"Right click on a shape to add a control point.\n"
"Left click on a control point and drag to move it.\n"
"Left click on a shape and drag to move the whole shape.\n"
"Hold {1} while right clicking on a control point and drag to change its "
